Class

A class is a blueprint used to create objects.

Object

An object is an instance of a class. It has state and behavior.

class Student {
    String name;

    void display() {
        System.out.println("Name: " + name);
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Student s = new Student();
        s.name = "Manjula";
        s.display();
    }
}

Output

Name: Manjula
